  "groundingSupports": [
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 212,
        "endIndex": 350,
        "text": "**What is confirmed:** Microsoft experienced a major, multi-region cloud outage starting November 12, 2026, and extending into November 13"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 352,
        "endIndex": 443,
        "text": "The incident impacted Exchange Online, Outlook, Teams, SharePoint, OneDrive, and Copilot AI"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        0,
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 445,
        "endIndex": 590,
        "text": "Microsoft confirmed that automated health checks failed on specific infrastructure components, causing server overloads and connectivity failures"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        2,
        3,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 675,
        "endIndex": 824,
        "text": "**Important caveats:** Microsoft has noted gradual recovery in parts of the Asia-Pacific and European infrastructure, but full restoration is ongoing"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 826,
        "endIndex": 880,
        "text": "Microsoft stated there is no evidence of a cyberattack"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        4,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1084,
        "endIndex": 1230,
        "text": "**What is confirmed:** Nvidia officially announced on November 12, 2026, that co-founder Jensen Huang resigned as President, CEO, and board member"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1232,
        "endIndex": 1331,
        "text": "CFO Colette Kress was named Interim CEO while the board conducts a search for a permanent successor"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1333,
        "endIndex": 1391,
        "text": "Harvey C. Jones was appointed as the board’s first Chair"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1393,
        "endIndex": 1616,
        "text": "The ouster followed public revelations of extramarital affairs, including one involving a technology executive suspected by U.S. intelligence of links to Chinese intelligence, and another involving a senior Nvidia executive"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        6,
        7,
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1620,
        "endIndex": 1756,
        "text": "**Important caveats:** Nvidia’s stock experienced sharp initial volatility (falling over 6% at announcement before closing down ~4.3%)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        6,
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1758,
        "endIndex": 1867,
        "text": "U.S. Congressional scrutiny and federal reviews into potential export and security implications remain active"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        7,
        9,
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 2027,
        "endIndex": 2269,
        "text": "**What is confirmed:** *WIRED* reported on November 13, 2026, that an internal Nvidia employee message board post urging the board to reinstate Jensen Huang gathered over 1,600 comments, with a large majority expressing support for his return"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        11,
        12
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 2273,
        "endIndex": 2401,
        "text": "**Important caveats:** This reflects internal employee forum sentiment rather than a formal board motion or corporate resolution"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 2403,
        "endIndex": 2527,
        "text": "Given the ongoing national security and legal investigations surrounding Huang's departure, reinstatement is highly unlikely"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        7,
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 2704,
        "endIndex": 2898,
        "text": "**What is confirmed:** Neocloud AI data center provider Nscale filed an amended Form S-1 disclosing that its total debt reached $5.5 billion as of September 2026 (up from $137.4 million in June)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 3072,
        "endIndex": 3295,
        "text": "**Important caveats:** Nscale remains heavily loss-making ($1 billion net loss in H1 2026 on $140.6 million revenue) and faces investor pushback regarding its proposed $30B+ IPO valuation given its high capital requirements"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        14,
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 4111,
        "endIndex": 4247,
        "text": "**What is confirmed:** South Korea's DeepX taped out its second-generation AI accelerator, the DX-M2, manufactured on a 2nm process node"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        16,
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 4249,
        "endIndex": 4418,
        "text": "The chip targets edge robotics and drones, designed to run 20B–100B parameter LLM inference under 5W using custom Samsung LPDDR5x Processing-in-Memory (PIM) technology"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        16,
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 4420,
        "endIndex": 4463,
        "text": "Mass production is targeted for autumn 2027"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 4467,
        "endIndex": 4701,
        "text": "**Important caveats:** Early performance metrics and memory throughput scaling (e.g., 6.7× boost on Llama3.1-8B) are based on architecture design specifications and PIM simulations; physical sample silicon is scheduled for March 2027"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        16,
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 4894,
        "endIndex": 5221,
        "text": "**What is confirmed:** A Reuters investigation by Eduardo Baptista reviewed over 150 Chinese public procurement notices, corporate filings, and construction records, identifying over 23 billion yuan ($3.2 billion) in AI computing projects built or planned around US-restricted Nvidia GPUs (including H100, H200, and H800 chips)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        18,
        19,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 5225,
        "endIndex": 5408,
        "text": "**Important caveats:** The $3.2 billion figure encompasses total project values (data center facilities, power infrastructure, and construction), not direct chip purchase totals alone"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        18,
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 5410,
        "endIndex": 5478,
        "text": "Some listed projects remain in planning or early construction stages"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        18,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 5648,
        "endIndex": 5787,
        "text": "**What is confirmed:** Anthropic launched its public IPO roadshow after updating its S-1 filing for a Nasdaq listing under the ticker `ANT`"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        21,
        22
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 5789,
        "endIndex": 5938,
        "text": "The company set a price band of $70–$78 per share across 825 million public shares, targeting a valuation between $1.26 trillion and $1.41 trillion"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        23,
        22
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 5942,
        "endIndex": 6054,
        "text": "**Important caveats:** Final pricing (expected Nov 18) and initial trading dates remain subject to SEC clearance"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        24,
        21
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 6056,
        "endIndex": 6223,
        "text": "Anthropic’s filing explicitly outlines substantial operating losses ($80.7 billion net loss in H1 2026) and multi-billion-dollar long-term infrastructure commitments"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        25
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 6394,
        "endIndex": 6588,
        "text": "**What is confirmed:** Google announced Gemini 4 Hydrogen, a lightweight model optimized for high-speed execution, agentic workflows, and everyday coding ($1.50/1M input, $7.50/1M output tokens)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        26
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 6590,
        "endIndex": 6776,
        "text": "Alongside the model, Google introduced \"Orchestrator\" in Google Antigravity, which dynamically routes tasks between Gemini 4 Carbon, Argon, and Hydrogen within a single developer session"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        26,
        27
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 6780,
        "endIndex": 6912,
        "text": "**Important caveats:** Speed and token efficiency claims are sourced from Google DeepMind model evaluation cards and benchmark tests"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        26
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 7076,
        "endIndex": 7330,
        "text": "**What is confirmed:** The Shenzhen Stock Exchange listing committee approved xFusion Digital Technologies (a former Huawei server business unit) to proceed with an 8 billion yuan (~$1.2 billion) IPO on the ChiNext board, issuing up to 220 million shares"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        28,
        29
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 7334,
        "endIndex": 7511,
        "text": "**Important caveats:** xFusion must still obtain final registration approval from the China Securities Regulatory Commission (CSRC) before setting a price range and listing date"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 7672,
        "endIndex": 8007,
        "text": "**What is confirmed:** OpenAI announced two agentic cybersecurity products at its Cyber at the Frontier event: **Daybreak Red Team** (an early-access service using AI agents for web application penetration testing) and **Daybreak Defense Factory** (an automated system that traces code vulnerabilities and drafts tested GitHub patches)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        30,
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 8011,
        "endIndex": 8086,
        "text": "**Important caveats:** Daybreak Red Team is currently in gated early access"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        32,
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 8088,
        "endIndex": 8184,
        "text": "Defense Factory patches require human engineer approval before merging and are not auto-deployed"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        30,
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 8359,
        "endIndex": 8534,
        "text": "**What is confirmed:** Bloomberg reported on November 12, 2026, that Samsung Electronics is in talks to acquire US-based data center cooling systems maker Modine Manufacturing"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        33,
        34
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 8536,
        "endIndex": 8606,
        "text": "Following the news, Modine shares surged ~28–29% in extended trading"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        33,
        35
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 8610,
        "endIndex": 8749,
        "text": "**Important caveats:** Discussions are ongoing; no definitive agreement has been signed, and talks could fall apart or yield another suitor"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        33,
        35
      ]
    },
    {
